{"5146570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dreadlines", "steam_appid": 5146570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/0692a8a13cba65401f3c7d0e0096c628.poster.avif?t=1788037473\" width=43 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/0692a8a13cba65401f3c7d0e0096c628.webm?t=1788037473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/4943c49b241650971b0fd61f0a531363.avif?t=1788037473\" width=664 height=89 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/00e0176c00042e6c5d1b7c1628681a10.poster.avif?t=1788037473\" width=43 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/00e0176c00042e6c5d1b7c1628681a10.webm?t=1788037473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One unemployed morning, an email lands in your inbox: You got the job! You don't know the company or remember applying, but you've been jobless for too long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreadlines</strong> is a monster office dating sim about connections, deadlines and falling for your undead coworkers. Answer emails, survive small talk, that sort of thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/3412fbb581aee4dc53a877676dd87486.avif?t=1788037473\" width=434 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/1e6a2ec81b9a1db5bab851b72f31cb4f.poster.avif?t=1788037473\" width=43 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/1e6a2ec81b9a1db5bab851b72f31cb4f.webm?t=1788037473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vivian Elricson, CEO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries old. Devastating in a boardroom. Cannot operate a computer without help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/cb894470e235ed0d1ebce1e5002d8e7f.webp?t=1788037473\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/cb894470e235ed0d1ebce1e5002d8e7f.poster.avif?t=1788037473\" class=\"bb_img\" width=43 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Penny Stein, Secretary</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprisingly warm and patient. Her heart might not beat, but that doesn't mean it's not big.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/6413af004f17c1234e0ae3a371be6ce9.poster.avif?t=1788037473\" width=43 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/6413af004f17c1234e0ae3a371be6ce9.webm?t=1788037473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amara Vargas, Customer Relations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp, unimpressed, and the only reason anything in this building functions. Hates when people look right through her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/01ac30bca39a872c5276eb9f66dbbd0b.webp?t=1788037473\" width=21 height=16 /></span>   ...and man̵͓̍y̶̲͆ ̸̟͗m̶͙̈ȯ̴̯r̵̩̉ḛ̶̕!̵̰̑   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/01ac30bca39a872c5276eb9f66dbbd0b.webp?t=1788037473\" width=21 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/396c194feb4dac42e96352b11f3db5fb.avif?t=1788037473\" width=616 height=89 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three romance routes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Painfully dry humor</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A blank slate protagonist: </strong>You are the new hire, whoever you are. Every route is possible either way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that stick: </strong>Trust builds quietly in the background. Small choices matter!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minigames, like a typo hunt and a first-person shooter segment: </strong>Yes, really</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hand-drawn cast and a retro UI: </strong>Expressive sprites and chunky nineties windows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something in the walls:</strong> The 4th wall is made to be broken, and the game is hiding more than it admits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional depth in places you might not expect right away</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wishlist Dreadlines</strong> so you don't miss the launch! <br><strong>Demo coming soon</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/0692a8a13cba65401f3c7d0e0096c628.poster.avif?t=1788037473\" width=43 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/0692a8a13cba65401f3c7d0e0096c628.webm?t=1788037473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/4943c49b241650971b0fd61f0a531363.avif?t=1788037473\" width=664 height=89 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/00e0176c00042e6c5d1b7c1628681a10.poster.avif?t=1788037473\" width=43 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/00e0176c00042e6c5d1b7c1628681a10.webm?t=1788037473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One unemployed morning, an email lands in your inbox: You got the job! You don't know the company or remember applying, but you've been jobless for too long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreadlines</strong> is a monster office dating sim about connections, deadlines and falling for your undead coworkers. Answer emails, survive small talk, that sort of thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/3412fbb581aee4dc53a877676dd87486.avif?t=1788037473\" width=434 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/1e6a2ec81b9a1db5bab851b72f31cb4f.poster.avif?t=1788037473\" width=43 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/1e6a2ec81b9a1db5bab851b72f31cb4f.webm?t=1788037473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vivian Elricson, CEO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries old. Devastating in a boardroom. Cannot operate a computer without help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/cb894470e235ed0d1ebce1e5002d8e7f.webp?t=1788037473\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/cb894470e235ed0d1ebce1e5002d8e7f.poster.avif?t=1788037473\" class=\"bb_img\" width=43 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Penny Stein, Secretary</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprisingly warm and patient. Her heart might not beat, but that doesn't mean it's not big.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/6413af004f17c1234e0ae3a371be6ce9.poster.avif?t=1788037473\" width=43 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/6413af004f17c1234e0ae3a371be6ce9.webm?t=1788037473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amara Vargas, Customer Relations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp, unimpressed, and the only reason anything in this building functions. Hates when people look right through her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/01ac30bca39a872c5276eb9f66dbbd0b.webp?t=1788037473\" width=21 height=16 /></span>   ...and man̵͓̍y̶̲͆ ̸̟͗m̶͙̈ȯ̴̯r̵̩̉ḛ̶̕!̵̰̑   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/01ac30bca39a872c5276eb9f66dbbd0b.webp?t=1788037473\" width=21 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/extras/396c194feb4dac42e96352b11f3db5fb.avif?t=1788037473\" width=616 height=89 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three romance routes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Painfully dry humor</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A blank slate protagonist: </strong>You are the new hire, whoever you are. Every route is possible either way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that stick: </strong>Trust builds quietly in the background. Small choices matter!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minigames, like a typo hunt and a first-person shooter segment: </strong>Yes, really</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hand-drawn cast and a retro UI: </strong>Expressive sprites and chunky nineties windows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something in the walls:</strong> The 4th wall is made to be broken, and the game is hiding more than it admits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional depth in places you might not expect right away</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wishlist Dreadlines</strong> so you don't miss the launch! <br><strong>Demo coming soon</strong></p>", "short_description": "Live two of your wildest fantasies: Being employed AND talking to women! Date your undead coworkers, survive corporate deadlines and try not to lose your soul in this satirical monster office dating sim.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/4201a9177fccdd5514a51f47099fd63fdd12b542/header.jpg?t=1788037473", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/8c3686622585763988765f808c95112f147120cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788037473", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5146570/8c3686622585763988765f808c95112f147120cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788037473", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.5 GHz dual-core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 or DirectX 11 compatible graphics with 1 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows-compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Mouse required. Renders at 2560x1440 internally and scales to your display resolution.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz quad-core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU with 2 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows-compatible sound card, headphones recommended</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS (64-bit), SteamOS 3, or a comparable distribution<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.5 GHz dual-core (x86_64)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 compatible GPU with 1 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> PulseAudio or PipeWire compatible audio device<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 64-bit x86 only. Mouse or touchpad required. Renders at 2560x1440 internally and scales to your display resolution.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 LTS or newer, or SteamOS 3<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz quad-core (x86_64)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU with 2 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> PipeWire compatible audio device<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1920x1080 display or higher.</li></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "Legal Notice / Imprint<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTom Matthias Timmann<br />\r\nZimt Games, Game Developer<br />\r\nSteinweg 19<br />\r\n63654 